{"id":"affiche","lemma":"affiche","pos":"noun","rank":3453,"glosses":["poster","placard","sign"],"ipa":"/a.fiʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/Fr-affiche.ogg/Fr-affiche.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"affiches"},"formAudio":{"affiches":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-affiches.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le concert affiche déjà complet.","en":"The concert is already sold out.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"concert"},null,{"g":"already, before"},{"g":"full"}]},{"text":"J'ai accroché quelques affiches au mur.","en":"I hung some posters on the wall.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to hook, hook up","l":"accrocher"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"wall"}]},{"text":"Il s'arrêta pour regarder l'affiche.","en":"He paused to look at the poster.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to look at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Y a-t-il de bons films à l'affiche cette semaine ?","en":"Are there any good movies being shown this week?","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"movie, film","l":"film"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"week"}]},{"text":"La Joconde affiche un sourire énigmatique.","en":"The Mona Lisa has an enigmatic smile.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Mona Lisa"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"to smile"},{"g":"enigmatic"}]}]}